Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:02.00,0:00:08.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,持續愛撫乳頭性交 水野朝陽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:18.72,0:00:22.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,水野 這邊請\N好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:25.82,0:00:28.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,那請坐在那裡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:31.70,0:00:33.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,早安\N早安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:34.94,0:00:37.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,水野 關於今天
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:38.35,0:00:40.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,有聽說過拍攝內容嗎?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:42.28,0:00:46.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,並沒有聽說\N沒聽說?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:48.42,0:00:50.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,說是普通的...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:53.36,0:00:55.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,聽說是普通拍攝?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:56.29,0:00:59.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,雖然沒有超出普通的範疇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:01.36,0:01:04.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,本日的主題啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:05.24,0:01:06.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,是乳頭啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:07.54,0:01:08.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,乳頭?\N乳頭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:09.73,0:01:11.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,不是男人的乳頭哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:12.17,0:01:13.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,水野你好像會錯意
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:14.51,0:01:17.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,不是挑逗男人的乳頭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.32,0:01:20.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,是逗水野你乳頭的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:20.87,0:01:23.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,被玩弄?\N就是被玩弄的劇情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:26.06,0:01:29.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,只有乳頭?\N乳頭...嘛 其他的也會摸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:29.94,0:01:33.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,當然 就算只有摸乳頭...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:34.33,0:01:38.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,也會那個的 只不過 乳頭...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:39.88,0:01:42.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,要一直摸著
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:44.34,0:01:48.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,是嗎?\N你的乳頭敏感嗎? 水野
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:50.07,0:01:53.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,是會有感覺...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:53.94,0:01:56.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,啊 有感覺?\N嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:57.12,0:01:59.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,用乳頭高潮
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:59.78,0:02:02.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,有用乳頭高潮過嗎?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:03.82,0:02:07.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,用乳頭...\N沒什麼記憶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:07.98,0:02:11.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,用乳頭...今天...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:12.38,0:02:16.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,高潮什麼的 像是請你用乳頭爽..
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:16.83,0:02:20.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,拍攝..簡略來說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:21.46,0:02:23.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,一定很厲害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:23.20,0:02:26.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,對 就是如此\N嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:27.32,0:02:32.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,趕緊的 可以拜見水野的乳頭嗎?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:32.84,0:02:36.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,什麼都還沒有哦\N沒關係
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:37.60,0:02:41.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,想從正常的乳頭開始看啊\N正常的也可以嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:43.33,0:02:46.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,想看戰鬥狀態前的乳頭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:56.48,0:02:59.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,也請脫掉胸罩 因為看不到乳頭啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:07.90,0:03:11.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,真的什麼都還沒有\N沒關係
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:12.30,0:03:15.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,可以嗎?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:16.30,0:03:19.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,那請給我看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:41.55,0:03:45.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,什麼都還沒有的狀態?\N什麼都還沒有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:47.52,0:03:50.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,那是前端還沒變成戰鬥狀態的意思吧？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:51.86,0:03:54.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:54.71,0:03:56.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,硬度\N硬度?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:57.00,0:04:00.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,現在很軟是吧?\N現在很軟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:01.54,0:04:05.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,像肉棒一樣嘛\N是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:05.78,0:04:08.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,就是這麼意思啊\N是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:10.93,0:04:13.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,感覺已經挺硬的了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:16.62,0:04:19.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,不過一摸的話是很軟的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:29.02,0:04:33.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,有試過這樣子仔細拍乳頭嗎?\N有試過嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:35.95,0:04:37.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,沒有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:38.15,0:04:41.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,我的乳頭 好像是很大的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:46.52,0:04:49.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,那麼的...拍過的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:51.59,0:04:54.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,好像沒有吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:55.59,0:04:59.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,趕緊的 柔軟狀態的乳頭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:00.53,0:05:03.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,可以讓人來摸你嗎?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:11.61,0:05:14.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,要摸了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:16.55,0:05:19.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,看這邊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:42.57,0:05:46.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,離進入狀態還很遠啊\N是很遠 這摸法...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:49.51,0:05:52.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,被輕輕撫摸著
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:15.37,0:06:17.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,接近了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:59.58,0:07:02.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,這摸法..
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:09.98,0:07:12.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,喜歡溫柔的嗎?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:15.60,0:07:18.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,不曉得 外表..
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:19.61,0:07:22.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,我想是沒什麼變化的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:23.93,0:07:27.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,現在已經挺硬的了\N變硬了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:48.57,0:07:51.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,等等
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:03.85,0:08:06.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,能看出變硬的感覺哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:08.28,0:08:11.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,真的嗎?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:13.05,0:10:15.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,水野 乳頭...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:17.96,0:10:21.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,被揉捏著的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:22.59,0:10:25.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,下面是變怎樣了啊?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:29.53,0:10:32.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,.... 現在...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:35.16,0:10:40.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,濕了\N濕了？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:46.61,0:10:51.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,那可以請你讓我看嗎?\N裙子脫掉吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:17.57,0:11:20.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,好厲害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:25.13,0:11:27.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,腳張開
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:31.59,0:11:34.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,請看這邊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:34.52,0:11:37.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,內褲變怎樣了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:39.60,0:11:42.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,濕了..
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:53.61,0:11:57.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,有看到嗎? 內褲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:59.02,0:12:01.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,變怎樣了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:12.56,0:12:15.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,濕了哦 痕跡好大一片
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:29.51,0:12:32.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,下面被怎麼摸會爽?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:37.99,0:12:40.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,陰蒂...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:44.59,0:12:48.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,要怎麼摸陰蒂?\N用手指
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:50.60,0:12:57.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,摳弄的...\N那自己從內褲上摳弄著
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:34.51,0:13:37.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,從內褲上摳弄的也爽?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:41.86,0:13:44.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,會變大
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:47.59,0:13:50.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,直接摸的話會變怎樣?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:58.26,0:14:01.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,會很爽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:04.54,0:14:07.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,會高潮
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:08.55,0:14:11.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,那脫掉內褲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:11.95,0:14:15.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,用手指多摸點自己會爽的地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:07.76,0:15:10.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,弄自己會爽的地方 用手指
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:17.55,0:15:20.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,這裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:57.59,0:16:00.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,不行要去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:20.54,0:16:23.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,要用這個嗎?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:25.62,0:16:28.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,會更爽哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:20.60,0:17:23.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:27.54,0:17:30.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,邊看這邊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:46.50,0:17:49.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:51.57,0:17:54.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,要去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:04.51,0:18:07.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,請看鏡頭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:29.61,0:18:32.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,弄爽快的地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:31.53,0:19:34.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:36.61,0:19:39.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,要去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:17.58,0:20:20.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,不行 要去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:53.62,0:20:56.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:59.62,0:21:02.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,要去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:24.58,0:21:27.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,很爽嗎?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:35.16,0:21:37.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,想不想做愛啊?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:40.60,0:21:43.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,想做\N想做是吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:46.60,0:21:49.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,那換個地方吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:05.56,0:22:08.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,就這樣子?\N是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:22.88,0:22:25.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,直走哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:00.54,0:23:03.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,等等 不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:20.56,0:23:23.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,面向這邊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:45.58,0:24:48.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,爽嗎?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:49.59,0:24:52.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,好爽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:04.53,0:25:07.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,再多摸點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:50.87,0:25:54.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,想要激烈點吧?\N激烈的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:56.59,0:25:59.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,你做啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:49.50,0:27:52.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,好吃哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:58.58,0:28:01.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,好爽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:52.50,0:28:55.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,這邊也要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:23.10,0:29:26.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,再幫你多弄點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:30.53,0:29:33.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,這邊也有感覺對吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:56.56,0:29:59.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:02.57,0:30:05.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:11.51,0:30:14.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,要去了
