Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:24.51,0:31:27.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,舌頭好爽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:23.51,0:32:26.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,好厲害
