Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:27.57,0:33:30.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,要去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:49.59,0:33:52.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,陰蒂...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:02.54,0:34:05.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:09.61,0:34:12.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,要去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:18.21,0:34:21.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,接著換你在上面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:26.56,0:34:29.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,乳頭和乳頭磨蹭著
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:56.59,0:34:59.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,!Effect,來互舔
